msgid "Import Settings."
msgstr "درون‌ریزی تنظیمات."

#: includes/tools_help.php:46
msgid ""
"This is helpful when you want to quickly set up WPeMatico on a new site "
"using a configuration that you've previously exported."
msgstr ""
